c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莲华峰法云即事五首 其五","author":"刘弇","text":"十十五五跳波鱼，三三两两踏歌姝。\n前山后山碧一色，似不多愧潇洒图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55290,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵屯阻风书怀示黄成伯章子脩二首 其一","author":"刘弇","text":"漾漾云?躐尾行，北来风力大粗生。\n与君更向春容里，暗听虾蟆数击更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55291,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵屯阻风书怀示黄成伯章子脩二首 其二","author":"刘弇","text":"故家曾是鸟巢南，欲折归心迫片帆。\n十载萍根浮履舄，令人羞涩对青衫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55292,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次前韵 其一","author":"刘弇","text":"心逐云容初欲远，身同春物乍欣生。\n不缘旅泊蹉跎去，一任江波岁月更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55293,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次前韵 其二","author":"刘弇","text":"白浪差差沮我南，祗成重酿破风帆。\n半生感慨轻儿女，翻笑江州泪湿衫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55294,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送徐择之秘校还雎阳二首 其一","author":"刘弇","text":"华裾照地雎阳客，入手当年有春色。\n家山归梦不须多，岁晚青翰天际识。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55295,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送徐择之秘校还雎阳二首 其二","author":"刘弇","text":"汴水东头古堞开，青鸳舞影几楼台。\n莫将归雁比行色，身未到家春已来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55296,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书国清寺清晓上人壁","author":"刘弇","text":"老师八十大僧生，头插吴龟见寿徵。\n斸开云根作活计，隐约百尺飞觚棱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55297,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和许亢秀才适轩三咏 其一 小木","author":"刘弇","text":"卑枝已能分好月，况复地力能新培。\n托根反出社木后，正使匠石愁无材。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55298,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和许亢秀才适轩三咏 其二 小池","author":"刘弇","text":"吾闻水月故相摄，小水还同大虚量。\n谁掬银潢下九秋，更想灵槎到天上。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55299,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和许亢秀才适轩三咏 其三 小山","author":"刘弇","text":"蛰龙蟠地秃角出，便讶云物储其间。\n由来浪费康乐屐，自可对面酬商颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55300,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题屈原","author":"刘弇","text":"直魄忠魂不复生，后来谁与继英声。\n只因一派潇湘水，千古澄波伴独清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55301,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题增城驻舟亭","author":"刘弇","text":"一亭潇洒枕江流，水色山光四面浮。\n多少客帆檐外过，不知谁是济川舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55302,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题韶州韶石亭","author":"刘弇","text":"数层顽石立孤岑，代往碑讹事莫寻。\n惟有汤汤亭下水，至今犹似奏韶音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55303,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊韶州宣溪亭","author":"刘弇","text":"昔年吏部谪韶州，曾向宣溪泊暮舟。\n多少烟波愁不尽，一时留与后人愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55304,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]